    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "you say it's a lie but it doesn't feel like one. it feels like math. if i'm just causing damage every day i'm alive, then staying around is just selfish, isn't it? it's like staying in a room when you know you're breaking everything in it. wouldn't the most decent, most selfless thing actually be to just bow out so no one else has to deal with the mess i am?",
